.. note::

   Some names in the examples come from VUnit, not from this package: ``runner_cfg``, ``get_seed``,
   ``output_path``, ``tb_path`` and ``check_equal`` from the
   `run and check libraries <https://vunit.github.io/run/user_guide.html>`_; ``net``, ``as_sync`` and
   ``wait_until_idle`` from the `com library <https://vunit.github.io/com/user_guide.html>`_;
   ``get_id``, ``get_logger``, ``disable_stop``, ``get_log_count`` and ``reset_log_count`` from the
   `logging library <https://vunit.github.io/logging/user_guide.html>`_; and ``integer_array_t`` from
   the `data types <https://vunit.github.io/data_types/user_guide.html>`_. The family context clause
   (``ethernet_context``, ``flash_context`` or ``property_context``) makes them all visible.
